/* Privacy */
"privacy_policy_title" = "Privacy";
"privacy_policy_updated" = "Updated: 9 September 2026";
"privacy_policy_body" = "EVforME? estimates on-device whether an electric or plug-in hybrid car may fit you.\n\nKept on your phone: km, prices, chosen vehicles, scenario history, widget/Live Activity snapshots.\n\nSticker photos: used on-device only to read consumption figures; not uploaded for that feature.\n\nNetwork (optional): vehicle catalog, public energy prices, analytics or lead webhook only if configured. In a typical build, analytics/leads stay local when those URLs are empty.\n\nWe do not sell data and do not use advertising trackers.\n\nAdvisor form: name/email/city only if you submit them with consent.\n\nYou can revoke photo access in iOS Settings, skip the lead form, or delete the app to remove local data.\n\nApp Store Connect also needs a public HTTPS URL with the full policy (see PRIVACY_POLICY.md in the repo).";
"privacy_policy_open_web" = "Open policy on the web";

